{
  "title": "Kensington Palace",
  "body": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Kensington Palace</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"> is a royal residence set in </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kensington_Gardens\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Kensington Gardens</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">, in the </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Royal_Borough_of_Kensington_and_Chelsea\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Royal Borough of Kensington and Chelsea</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"> in London, England. It has been a residence of the </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/British_Royal_Family\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">British Royal Family</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"> since the 17th century, and is the official London residence of the </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_William,_Duke_of_Cambridge\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Duke</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"> and </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catherine,_Duchess_of_Cambridge\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Duchess of Cambridge</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">, </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_Harry\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Prince Harry</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">, the </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_Richard,_Duke_of_Gloucester\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Duke</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"> and </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Birgitte,_Duchess_of_Gloucester\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Duchess of Gloucester</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">, the </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_Edward,_Duke_of_Kent\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Duke</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"> and </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katharine,_Duchess_of_Kent\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Duchess of Kent</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"> and </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_Michael_of_Kent\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Prince</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"> and </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Princess_Michael_of_Kent\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Princess Michael of Kent</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">.</span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Today, the State Rooms are open to the public and managed by the independent charity </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Historic_Royal_Palaces\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Historic Royal Palaces</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">, a nonprofit organization that does not receive public funds. The offices and private accommodation areas of the Palace remain the responsibility of the </span><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Royal_Households_of_the_United_Kingdom\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">Royal Household</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 'Calibri','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"> and are maintained by the Royal Household Property Section.</span></p>",
